        "title": "Ideal gaz tenglamasi",
        "body": "Ideal gazning berilgan Mendeleyev–Klapeyron tenglamasi PV=nRT. P — bosim, V — hajm, n — modda miqdori, T — Kelvin harorati. Bu darsdagi hisoblar ideal modelga tegishli; har qanday real gaz uchun shartsiz aniq tenglik deb olinmaydi.",
